"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-21T13:24:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T13:52:59Z","closed_at":"2026-09-10T13:52:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16438","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16438","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16438.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16438.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\n- Allows setting descriptions on env schema config\r\n- Useful for describing where variables come from, how to generate them, etc.\r\n- Description will be emitted in generated typescript definition file, for intellisense &c.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nAdditional config was added to a test fixture, and generated typescript definition was manually verified.\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nProbably could add a note in https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/environment-variables/#type-safe-environment-variables\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16438/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16079","id":4134899852,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q87NU14y","number":16079,"title":"fix(vercel): Fix ISR path rewrite to prevent 404","user":{"login":"empoulter-uclan","id":128381217,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6bxIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128381217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan","html_url":"https://github.com/empoulter-uclan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-03-25T12:02:19Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T17:12:16Z","closed_at":"2026-03-25T16:40:00Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/16079","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16079","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16079.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/16079.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-25T16:40:00Z"},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\nFix a bug which prevented pages from being served by ISR by the vercel adapter.\r\n\r\n[This PR](https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15959) introduced a bug with the vercel adaptor which made any route served by ISR result in a 404. This is due to an intricacy with how vercel ISR works, in that we need to change the request path when serving an ISR path. This was noticed by [a commenter](github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15959#issuecomment-4103539941) in the PR.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nNo additional test cases added. Manual e2e tests performed on [a test vercel project](https://isr-with-query-i5fzjrhph-epoulter-uclanacuks-projects.vercel.app/one) (note this includes other code from another PR I am working on, but the upshot is that it is a ISR page, which does not 404, as opposed to [an earlier deployment without this fix](https://isr-with-query-4jzt20i06-epoulter-uclanacuks-projects.vercel.app/one) which does 404).\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nNo docs needed as a bug fix for internal adapter logic\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/16079/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092","id":3772291188,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q867FD_h","number":15092,"title":"feat(vercel): Allow specifying ISR cached query params","user":{"login":"empoulter-uclan","id":128381217,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6bxIQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128381217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan","html_url":"https://github.com/empoulter-uclan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/empoulter-uclan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-12-31T08:30:22Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T12:16:02Z","closed_at":"2026-03-24T22:22:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15092","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15092.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\n- Adds ability to specify query parameters to pass through to an ISR route in the vercel integration\r\n- This means that pages with different query parameters will be cached separately by vercel, depending on configuration. \r\n- This is useful for rendering different page content based on the query value, while maintaining good cache coverage\r\n- This was an option long possible with the [vercel build output](https://vercel.com/docs/build-output-api/primitives#prerender-configuration-file) but which was not exposed by the integration.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- Added new test case to test the new configuration option\r\n- Ran some manual tests in a vercel deploy to verify the correct options were passed through: the ISR page https://isr-with-query.vercel.app/one?param-1=is-allowed&param-3=not-allowed correctly consumes the 'param-1' key, but not the 'param-3' key, per the configuration.\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\nAn update to the documentation for the vercel isr config will probably be necessary to explain the added option to [here](https://github.com/withastro/docs/blob/main/src/content/docs/en/guides/integrations-guide/vercel.mdx#isr). This would pretty much just reference [the vercel config option](https://vercel.com/docs/build-output-api/primitives#prerender-configuration-file), as we are basically just passing it straight through. I'm happy to add if merged. \r\n\r\n/cc @withastro/maintainers-docs for feedback!\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15092/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}